  "transformedHtml": "<article class=\"legal-article\" id=\"art-5\">\n  <header class=\"article-header\">\n    <h2 class=\"article-number\">Article 5</h2>\n  </header>\n  <div class=\"article-content\">\n    <div class=\"article-text\">\n      <p class=\"intro-text\">Dans l'article 64 du même arrêté, modifié en dernier lieu par l'arrêté royal du 30 août 2013, est inséré le 1°/1 rédigé comme suit :</p>\n      <ol class=\"numbered-provisions\">\n        <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"1°/1\">\n          <span class=\"provision-text\">sans préjudice du 1°, les vacances qui restent encore à prendre suite à l'une des causes de suspensions prévues aux articles 16,</span>\n          <ol class=\"numbered-provisions\">\n            <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"1°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">1°</span></li>\n            <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"2°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">2°</span></li>\n            <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"3°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">3°</span></li>\n            <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"4°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">4°</span></li>\n            <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"15°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">15°</span></li>\n            <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"18°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">18°</span></li>\n            <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"19°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">19°</span></li>\n            <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"22°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">22°</span></li>\n            <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"24°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">24°</span></li>\n          </ol>\n          <span class=\"provision-text\">et 41,</span>\n          <ol class=\"numbered-provisions\">\n            <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"1°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">1°</span></li>\n            <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"2°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">2°</span></li>\n            <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"3°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">3°</span></li>\n            <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"4°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">4°</span></li>\n            <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"13°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">13°</span></li>\n            <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"15°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">15°</span></li>\n            <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"16°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">16°</span></li>\n            <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"21°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">21°</span></li>\n            <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"23°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">23°</span></li>\n          </ol>\n          <span class=\"provision-text\">doivent être prises dans les vingt-quatre mois qui suivent la fin de l'année de vacances pour laquelle ces journées de vacances restent encore à prendre;</span>\n        </li>\n      </ol>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</article>",
